    <h2>About Us</h2>
    <p>Newline-PCB is specialized in importing PCB of all kinds and of any amounts, as few pieces (prototype), as well medium and large quantities, simple and complex circuits, rigid, flex and rigid flex circuits, aluminum pcb's and those that are made of special materials (for various applications) – circuits with blind via and with buried via, with special materials such as – polyamide, Rogers, Kepton, Arlon, Panasonic, Nelco, Taconic, etc.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--alt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-two-col">
      <div class="about-two-col__body">
        <p>Newline-pcb is a company for imported printed circuits boards, and was established by Ron Netzer, who has been in the PCB field for many years.</p>
        <p>Ron is well known in that market for his roles as sales manager, and has very good relations with many customers — with knowledge of their different demands and requests very well. Ron has very good connections with a variety of factors in the Israeli industry and in Europe and the Far East as well, and has very good relations with editors, planners, and assembly companies.</p>
        <p>Thanks to Ron's elaborate connections, Ron knows how and when to connect customer requirements from the planning stage through to assembly and production.</p>
        <p>And even gives full turnkey solutions.</p>
      </div>
