<section class="section">
  <div class="container container--narrow">
    <p><strong>Newline-PCB is related to a few highly professional companies – each one is an expert in its field and with various manufacturing capabilities.</strong></p>
    <p>Newline-PCB gives a quick and affordable solution for simple circuits with full devotion to the highest quality.</p>
    <p>Newline-PCB gives a solution for manufacturing circuits of 4–14 layers of medium up to high level, from small amounts and up to mass production — again, with the guarantee of highest quality of the circuits.</p>
    <p>All the companies that work with Newline-PCB are accredited by all the advanced standards, while maintaining environmental standards.</p>
    <p>Newline-PCB gives the most high-qualified solution for complex circuits, which demand high capabilities and professionalism. We have the best solution from a qualified company in the USA that is competent to produce circuits for Boeing and NASA!</p>
    <p>All the circuits are checked electronically and visually (at least twice) before being delivered to the client. Newline-PCB's main priority is the satisfaction of our clients. To deliver this, we focus on reliable service, fast response, high quality, and engineering support during all stages of production.</p>
    <p>And of course – affordable prices in the competitive market.</p>
    <p>Newline-PCB is active in the telecom, medicine, commercial and even military markets.</p>
    <p>We'll be happy to help and advise on ancillary subjects of circuit production, starting from the engineering point, up to consulting in planning the printed circuit. We also give solutions in editing circuits, up to the phase of constructing the circuits. Newline-PCB has the ability to perform "turn-key" projects up to medium quantities, including purchasing components from leading manufacturers in Israel and the Far East. We have a lot of knowledge, connections and experience in this area.</p>
    <p><strong>We'll be glad to have you as one of our clients.</strong></p>
